          "id": "code-ml-28-1-ch28_1_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles NumPy: Paradoks Saito & Rehmsmeier (N=100.000, pi=0.1%) — ROC-AUC vs AP & MCC",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "28_1_saito_rehmsmeier_rare_event_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(281)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# First-Principles NumPy: Paradoks Saito & Rehmsmeier pada Prevalensi 0.1%\n# N = 100.000 transaksi: P = 100 fraud sejati (0.1%), N_neg = 99.900 sah (99.9%)\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn_pos, n_neg = 100, 99_900\ny_true = np.concatenate([np.ones(n_pos, dtype=int), np.zeros(n_neg, dtype=int)])\n\n# Model A (Tajam di ekor atas): sebagian besar fraud punya skor jauh lebih tinggi dari transaksi sah\ns_pos_a = rng.normal(loc=2.95, scale=1.10, size=n_pos)\ns_neg_a = rng.normal(loc=0.0, scale=0.80, size=n_neg)\nscore_a = np.concatenate([s_pos_a, s_neg_a])\n\n# Model B (Menipu di ROC): ~1.0% transaksi sah (1.000 false alarm!) tercampur di ekor atas,\n# namun 99% sisanya jauh di kiri sehingga ROC-AUC tetap ~0.96 padahal Precision@R80 anjlok ke ~7-8%!\nn_hard_fp = int(0.010 * n_neg)  # 999 false alarm berskor tinggi!\ns_pos_b = rng.normal(loc=2.85, scale=1.15, size=n_pos)\ns_neg_b = np.concatenate([\n    rng.normal(loc=3.10, scale=0.55, size=n_hard_fp),\n    rng.normal(loc=-0.40, scale=0.85, size=n_neg - n_hard_fp),\n])\nscore_b = np.concatenate([s_pos_b, s_neg_b])\n\ndef roc_pr_ap_from_scratch(y: np.ndarray, s: np.ndarray) -> dict[str, float]:\n    order = np.argsort(-s, kind=\"mergesort\")\n    y_sorted = y[order]\n    s_sorted = s[order]\n    # Ambil indeks ujung setiap blok skor unik (menangani ties persis seperti sklearn)\n    distinct_idx = np.where(np.diff(s_sorted) != 0)[0]\n    thr_idx = np.r_[distinct_idx, y_sorted.size - 1]\n\n    tps = np.cumsum(y_sorted)[thr_idx]\n    fps = (1 + thr_idx) - tps\n    P = float(tps[-1])\n    N = float(fps[-1])\n\n    tpr = np.r_[0.0, tps / P]\n    fpr = np.r_[0.0, fps / N]\n    roc_auc = float(np.trapezoid(tpr, fpr))\n\n    precision = tps / (tps + fps)\n    recall = tps / P\n    # Step-function Average Precision: sum((R_k - R_{k-1}) * P_k)\n    rec_step = np.r_[0.0, recall]\n    ap_step = float(np.sum(np.diff(rec_step) * precision))\n    # Trapezoidal PR-AUC (interpolasi linier yang secara matematis optimis)\n    pr_trapz = float(np.trapezoid(np.r_[1.0, precision], np.r_[0.0, recall]))\n\n    # Operasi pada titik Recall ~ 80%\n    idx80 = int(np.searchsorted(recall, 0.80))\n    idx80 = min(idx80, len(recall) - 1)\n    tp80, fp80 = float(tps[idx80]), float(fps[idx80])\n    fn80, tn80 = P - tp80, N - fp80\n    prec80 = tp80 / (tp80 + fp80)\n    fpr80 = fp80 / N\n    denom = np.sqrt((tp80 + fp80) * (tp80 + fn80) * (tn80 + fp80) * (tn80 + fn80))\n    mcc80 = (tp80 * tn80 - fp80 * fn80) / denom if denom > 0 else 0.0\n\n    return {\n        \"roc_auc\": roc_auc,\n        \"ap_step\": ap_step,\n        \"pr_trapz\": pr_trapz,\n        \"fp_at_r80\": fp80,\n        \"fpr_at_r80\": fpr80,\n        \"prec_at_r80\": prec80,\n        \"mcc_at_r80\": mcc80,\n    }\n\nm_a = roc_pr_ap_from_scratch(y_true, score_a)\nm_b = roc_pr_ap_from_scratch(y_true, score_b)\n\nprint(\"=== Simulasi Saito-Rehmsmeier (N=100.000, Prevalensi pi = 0.10%) ===\")\nprint(f\"Baseline Tebak Acak | ROC-AUC = 0.5000 | Average Precision = {n_pos / (n_pos + n_neg):.4f}\")\nfor name, m in [(\"Model A (Tajam di Ekor Atas)\", m_a), (\"Model B (Alarm Palsu Massal)\", m_b)]:\n    print(\n        f\"{name:29s} | ROC-AUC={m['roc_auc']:.4f} | AP={m['ap_step']:.4f} | \"\n        f\"FP@R80={int(m['fp_at_r80']):4d} (FPR={m['fpr_at_r80']:.4f}) | \"\n        f\"Prec@R80={m['prec_at_r80']:6.2%} | MCC@R80={m['mcc_at_r80']:.4f}\"\n    )",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Simulasi Saito-Rehmsmeier (N=100.000, Prevalensi pi = 0.10%) ===\nBaseline Tebak Acak | ROC-AUC = 0.5000 | Average Precision = 0.0010\nModel A (Tajam di Ekor Atas)  | ROC-AUC=0.9837 | AP=0.6569 | FP@R80= 521 (FPR=0.0052) | Prec@R80=13.31% | MCC@R80=0.3250\nModel B (Alarm Palsu Massal)  | ROC-AUC=0.9755 | AP=0.1042 | FP@R80=1157 (FPR=0.0116) | Prec@R80= 6.47% | MCC@R80=0.2255",
          "actualOutput": "=== Simulasi Saito-Rehmsmeier (N=100.000, Prevalensi pi = 0.10%) ===\nBaseline Tebak Acak | ROC-AUC = 0.5000 | Average Precision = 0.0010\nModel A (Tajam di Ekor Atas)  | ROC-AUC=0.9837 | AP=0.6569 | FP@R80= 521 (FPR=0.0052) | Prec@R80=13.31% | MCC@R80=0.3250\nModel B (Alarm Palsu Massal)  | ROC-AUC=0.9755 | AP=0.1042 | FP@R80=1157 (FPR=0.0116) | Prec@R80= 6.47% | MCC@R80=0.2255",
          "explanation": "Mensimulasikan 100.000 transaksi dengan prevalensi fraud 0,10% (100 positif vs 99.900 negatif): membuktikan Model A dan Model B hanya berselisih tipis di ROC-AUC (0.9837 vs 0.9755), padahal Average Precision Model B anjlok 6.3x (0.6569 -> 0.1042) dan Precision@Recall=80% jatuh ke 6.47% akibat 1.157 false alarm.",
