          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef rare_event_metrology(y_true, y_score, threshold: float) -> tuple[float, float, float, float]:\n    y = np.asarray(y_true, dtype=int)\n    s = np.asarray(y_score, dtype=float)\n    order = np.argsort(-s, kind='mergesort')\n    y_s, s_s = y[order], s[order]\n    distinct = np.where(np.diff(s_s) != 0)[0]\n    idx = np.r_[distinct, y_s.size - 1]\n    tps = np.cumsum(y_s)[idx].astype(float)\n    fps = (1 + idx) - tps\n    P = float(tps[-1])\n    prec = tps / (tps + fps)\n    rec = tps / P\n    ap_step = float(np.sum(np.diff(np.r_[0.0, rec]) * prec))\n    pr_trapz = float(np.trapezoid(np.r_[1.0, prec], np.r_[0.0, rec]))\n    yh = (s >= threshold).astype(int)\n    tp = float(np.sum((y == 1) & (yh == 1)))\n    fp = float(np.sum((y == 0) & (yh == 1)))\n    fn = float(np.sum((y == 1) & (yh == 0)))\n    tn = float(np.sum((y == 0) & (yh == 0)))\n    denom = np.sqrt((tp + fp) * (tp + fn) * (tn + fp) * (tn + fn))\n    mcc = float((tp * tn - fp * fn) / denom) if denom > 0 else 0.0\n    prec_t = float(tp / (tp + fp)) if (tp + fp) > 0 else 0.0\n    return (round(ap_step, 4), round(pr_trapz, 4), round(mcc, 4), round(prec_t, 4))\n```"
