          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.metrics import brier_score_loss, log_loss\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2823)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Audit 1: Sensitivitas Label Noise — Log-Loss Meledak (-log(eps)) vs Brier Terbatas [0, 1]\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn = 4000\nz = rng.normal(loc=0.0, scale=6.5, size=n)\np_true = np.clip(1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-z)), 1e-5, 1.0 - 1e-5)\ny_clean = (rng.uniform(size=n) < p_true).astype(int)\n\n# Model sangat tajam & percaya diri tinggi (ekor di eps = 1e-5)\np_model = p_true.copy()\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Stress Test Label Noise pada Model Percaya Diri (eps = 1e-5) ===\")\nll_base = log_loss(y_clean, p_model)\nbs_base = brier_score_loss(y_clean, p_model)\nfor noise_rate in [0.0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.03]:\n    y_noisy = y_clean.copy()\n    if noise_rate > 0:\n        flip_idx = rng.choice(n, size=int(n * noise_rate), replace=False)\n        y_noisy[flip_idx] = 1 - y_noisy[flip_idx]\n    ll = log_loss(y_noisy, p_model)\n    bs = brier_score_loss(y_noisy, p_model)\n    print(\n        f\"Label Noise={noise_rate:5.1%} | LogLoss={ll:.4f} ({ll / ll_base:4.2f}x baseline) | \"\n        f\"Brier={bs:.4f} ({bs / bs_base:4.2f}x baseline)\"\n    )\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Audit 2: Jebakan Brier Score Mentah pada Prevalensi Langka (pi = 0.2%) vs BSS\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn_rare = 10_000\ny_rare = np.zeros(n_rare, dtype=int)\ny_rare[:20] = 1  # pi = 0.002 (20 kejadian langka)\nunc_rare = float(y_rare.mean() * (1.0 - y_rare.mean()))\n\np_all_zero = np.zeros(n_rare)\np_good = np.full(n_rare, 0.0005)\np_good[:16] = 0.45  # Menangkap 16/20 positif dengan probabilitas bermakna\np_good[20:40] = 0.45\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Jebakan Brier Mentah pada pi = 0.20% (UNC = 0.001996) ===\")\nfor label, ph in [(\"Model Dungu (Selalu p=0.0)\", p_all_zero), (\"Model Informatif Tajam\", p_good)]:\n    bs_v = brier_score_loss(y_rare, ph)\n    bss_v = 1.0 - bs_v / unc_rare\n    print(f\"{label:28s} | Brier Mentah={bs_v:.6f} | BSS={bss_v:+.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Stress Test Label Noise pada Model Percaya Diri (eps = 1e-5) ===\nLabel Noise= 0.0% | LogLoss=0.1937 (1.00x baseline) | Brier=0.0606 (1.00x baseline)\nLabel Noise= 0.5% | LogLoss=0.2086 (1.08x baseline) | Brier=0.0627 (1.03x baseline)\nLabel Noise= 1.0% | LogLoss=0.2425 (1.25x baseline) | Brier=0.0685 (1.13x baseline)\nLabel Noise= 3.0% | LogLoss=0.3574 (1.84x baseline) | Brier=0.0840 (1.39x baseline)\n\n=== 2. Jebakan Brier Mentah pada pi = 0.20% (UNC = 0.001996) ===\nModel Dungu (Selalu p=0.0)   | Brier Mentah=0.002000 | BSS=-0.0020\nModel Informatif Tajam       | Brier Mentah=0.001289 | BSS=+0.3543",
