          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.metrics import d2_pinball_score, ndcg_score\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2843)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Audit 1: Bencana Pemilihan Model dengan MAPE — Pengoptimal MAPE (-55% dari Median) Menang di MAPE!\n# Untuk Y ~ LogNormal(ln mu, sigma^2): Median (optimal WAPE) = mu,\n# sedangkan Pengoptimal MAPE analitis = mu * exp(-sigma^2) = 0.445 * mu!\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn = 1500\nmu_latent = rng.uniform(6.0, 28.0, size=n)\nsigma_noise = 0.90\ny_true = np.maximum(np.round(mu_latent * rng.lognormal(mean=0.0, sigma=sigma_noise, size=n), 1), 0.5)\n\n# Model A: peramal Median Sejati (optimal WAPE/MAE, stockout seimbang 50%)\npred_a = mu_latent.copy()\n# Model B: peramal CURANG pengoptimal MAPE (mu * exp(-sigma^2) ~ 0.45 * mu -> under-forecast ekstrem!)\npred_b = np.exp(-(sigma_noise ** 2)) * mu_latent\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Audit Under-Forecasting Trap (Y ~ LogNormal, Seluruh y_true >= 0.5) ===\")\nfor name, pr in [(\"Model A (Median Sejati / Optimal WAPE)\", pred_a), (\"Model B (Optimal MAPE = mu*e^-s^2)\", pred_b)]:\n    mape = float(np.mean(np.abs(y_true - pr) / y_true)) * 100.0\n    wape = float(np.sum(np.abs(y_true - pr)) / np.sum(y_true)) * 100.0\n    d2_p90 = d2_pinball_score(y_true, pr, alpha=0.90)\n    stockout_rate = float(np.mean(pr < y_true)) * 100.0\n    shortfall_units = float(np.sum(np.maximum(y_true - pr, 0.0)))\n    print(\n        f\"{name:38s} | MAPE={mape:6.2f}% | WAPE={wape:5.2f}% | \"\n        f\"D2_P90={d2_p90:+.4f} | Stockout={stockout_rate:5.1f}% | Defisit={shortfall_units:7.1f} unit\"\n    )\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Audit 2: Sensitivitas Posisi Logaritmik NDCG@5 (Top-1 Error vs Bottom-Swap)\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 5 item dengan relevansi ideal [3, 2, 1, 0, 0]\nrel = np.array([[3.0, 2.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0]])\nsc_ideal = np.array([[5.0, 4.0, 3.0, 2.0, 1.0]])\nsc_swap_bottom = np.array([[5.0, 4.0, 2.0, 3.0, 1.0]])  # Tukar posisi #3 (rel=1) & #4 (rel=0)\nsc_swap_top = np.array([[1.0, 4.0, 3.0, 2.0, 5.0]])     # Tukar posisi #1 (rel=3) & #5 (rel=0)!\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Penalti Posisi Logaritmik NDCG@5 ===\")\nprint(f\"Urutan Ideal [3, 2, 1, 0, 0]       : NDCG@5 = {ndcg_score(rel, sc_ideal, k=5):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Tukar Bawah  [3, 2, 0, 1, 0] (#3#4): NDCG@5 = {ndcg_score(rel, sc_swap_bottom, k=5):.4f} (turun -{1 - ndcg_score(rel, sc_swap_bottom, k=5):.4f})\")\nprint(f\"Tukar Puncak [0, 2, 1, 0, 3] (#1#5): NDCG@5 = {ndcg_score(rel, sc_swap_top, k=5):.4f} (turun -{1 - ndcg_score(rel, sc_swap_top, k=5):.4f}!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Under-Forecasting Trap (Y ~ LogNormal, Seluruh y_true >= 0.5) ===\nModel A (Median Sejati / Optimal WAPE) | MAPE= 93.34% | WAPE=63.69% | D2_P90=-0.5382 | Stockout= 49.9% | Defisit=19069.6 unit\nModel B (Optimal MAPE = mu*e^-s^2)     | MAPE= 62.71% | WAPE=74.27% | D2_P90=-1.2122 | Stockout= 82.5% | Defisit=28269.7 unit\n\n=== 2. Audit Penalti Posisi Logaritmik NDCG@5 ===\nUrutan Ideal [3, 2, 1, 0, 0]       : NDCG@5 = 1.0000\nTukar Bawah  [3, 2, 0, 1, 0] (#3#4): NDCG@5 = 0.9854 (turun -0.0146)\nTukar Puncak [0, 2, 1, 0, 3] (#1#5): NDCG@5 = 0.6137 (turun -0.3863!)",
